      "Text": "咦？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 200530170,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "老師大人"
    },
    {
      "Id": 200530180,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "運動服，我會好好穿的"
    },
    {
      "Id": 200530190,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "那個"
    },
    {
      "Id": 200530200,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "就是……謝謝你……"
    },
    {
      "Id": 200530210,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "還有剛才……對不……"
    },
    {
      "Id": 200530220,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "不！唔喵啊！果然還是一點都不覺得對不起！！"
    },
    {
      "Id": 200530230,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "（砰啪啪啪！）<-煙霧彈爆炸的聲音"
    },
    {
      "Id": 200530240,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "老師大人"
    },
    {
      "Id": 200530250,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "終於，傳來了"
    },
    {
      "Id": 200530260,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "傷勢完全康復的好消息"
    },
    {
      "Id": 200530270,
